# The interface surface of routers/data_ingest. Asserted by routers/tests/test_interface_surface.py.
# Format, field meanings and why this file is committed rather than generated: see README.md.
# Keep sorted. Adding an interface is meant to cost a line here, in the same diff.
#
# ZERO IS A DECLARATION HERE, NOT AN OVERSIGHT -- decision tj-3wgh03. data_ingest exposes nothing
# this file can enumerate: routers/data_ingest holds a domain handler (fetch_dataset_handler.py) and
# no wire type at all, by decision tj-tkm4tn D1, and it registers no HTTP route.
